        {"class": "DepictionSeparatorView"},
        {"class": "DepictionSubheaderView", "title": "2.6.4", "useBoldText": true, "useBottomMargin": false},
        {"class": "DepictionMarkdownView", "markdown": "- 对照 SingleVPN 原版数据流程处理 VPN 状态。\n\n- 保留真实 `vpnEntry`，由 SpringBoard 显示并关闭系统原生 VPN 胶囊。\n\n- 不使用假弹窗、状态服务器重放或人工动画计时。", "useSpacing": true, "useRawFormat": false}
